# Spotlight Card

Una colección de componentes de tarjetas con efectos de iluminación dinámicos que siguen el movimiento del ratón (haces de luz, degradados, brillos y efectos 3D).

## Instalación

::div{.space-y-4}
```bash
bunx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/spotlight-card.json
```

```bash
npx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/spotlight-card.json
```

```bash
pnpm dlx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/spotlight-card.json
```
::

## Uso

```vue
<script setup lang="ts">
import { 
  SpotlightCard, 
  SpotlightCardHeader, 
  SpotlightCardTitle, 
  SpotlightCardContent 
} from '@/registry/spotlight-card'
</script>

<template>
  <SpotlightCard>
    <SpotlightCardHeader>
      <SpotlightCardTitle>Efecto Spotlight</SpotlightCardTitle>
    </SpotlightCardHeader>
    <SpotlightCardContent>
      Pasa el ratón sobre esta tarjeta para ver el efecto.
    </SpotlightCardContent>
  </SpotlightCard>
</template>
```

